<title>SINGAPORE: Gul debut 55 pct premium on offer price.</title>
<headline>Gul debut 55 pct premium on offer price.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Printed circuit board maker Gul Technologies hit a high of Singapore $0.90 on its debut on Monday, a 55 percent premium on its initial public offer price of S$0.58.</p>
<p>The shares, 135 times subscribed in the offering earlier this month, saw 5.1 million units traded in the opening 10 minutes of business on the Stock Exchange of Singapore. At 0115 GMT, Gul Technologies shares stood at S$0.815.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
